# Guild apprentice variants

newmonster "Apothecary Apprentice"
copystats "Apothecary"
clearweapons
spellweapon               69   1 # Apothecary at level 1.
more1spells                   -1 # Starts with 1 less level 1 spell of each known school.
meleeweapon                0   1 # Dagger: d3 Pierce damage.
descr "Apothecary apprentices are only beginning their journey and have not yet earned the title of apothecary. They are so busy studying remedies and poisons that they lack the time or confidence to lead armies or perform complex rituals."

newmonster "Guild Alchemist Apprentice"
copystats "Guild Alchemist"
clearweapons
spellweapon               55   1 # Alchemy at level 1.
more1spells                   -1 # Starts with 1 less level 1 spell of each known school.
meleeweapon                0   1 # Dagger: d3 Pierce damage.
descr "A guild alchemist apprentice is just starting out, still buried in study and basic experimentation. They have not yet earned full guild standing and are too busy with their lessons to lead armies or handle complex rituals."

newmonster "Alchemist Magus Initiate"
copystats "Alchemist Magus"
clearweapons
spellweapon               55   1 # Alchemy at level 1.
spellweapon               51   1 # High Arcana at level 1.
meleeweapon                0   1 # Dagger: d3 Pierce damage.
descr "Not yet recognized as a true magus, the initiate cannot practice rituals or act independently. He travels with a guildmaster to prove himself to the academy and earn his place among the magi."

selectritual "Apothecaries Guild"
summoning
addstring "1*Apothecary Apprentice"
descr "The Guildmaster establishes an Apothecaries Guild in a settlement with trade value of 1 or more. Occasionally Apothecary commanders can be recruited, this chance increases for every Apothecaries Guild established. Income is increased by +1. An Apothecary Apprentice joins the Guildmaster. Can only be cast in trade locations."

selectritual "Alchemists Guild"
summoning
addstring "1*Guild Alchemist Apprentice"
descr "The Guildmaster upgrades an Apothecaries Guild into an Alchemists Guild. The Guildmaster can occasionally recruit Alchemists. The Alchemists Guild retains all features of the Apothecaries Guild. A Guild Alchemist Apprentice joins the Guildmaster. Can only be cast in trade locations."

selectritual "Alchemist Magus Guild"
summoning
addstring "1*Guild Alchemist"
descr "The Merchant Prince upgrades an Alchemists Guild into an Alchemist Magus Guild. The Guildmaster can occasionally recruit Alchemist Magi. The Alchemist Magus Guild retains all features of the Alchemists Guild. A Guild Alchemist joins the Guildmaster. Can only be cast in trade locations."

